  "full_text": "So there's an article Frazier wrote talking about the exchange. I told Frazier that Temple OS was a space alien trading post. And he goes, oh, I get it. So like you trade with other people and you use some kind of Bitcoin or something. No, Frazier, there really are angels. There really is God. You get gifts from God. Did you realize that they used to sacrifice bowls by the thousands? Fraser's going, yeah, they were just stupid. Fraser, you're a real good psychologist. Why don't you go do some forensic psychology and try to imagine how you would get thousands of people to do this, okay? Because, like, you ever notice, like, if you don't get results... You don't keep doing something, okay? Let me just tell you a little secret. Now, Frazier goes, oh, but they tricked him. They tricked him because they're stupid. Frazier, you're a shit psychologist, okay? I'm just saying you're a shit psychologist, okay? You don't know Jack's shit. It's very ironic, as a matter of fact. Fucking Frazier's a nigger. Frazier is a fucking nigger. He has no psychological skills whatsoever. Or he would look at the Bible and he would say, you can't make this shit up. Frazier is a fucking nigger. He's fucking retarded as fuck.",
